graph TD
    Internet((Internet)) --> ALB[Public ALB]
    ALB --> App[App Tier Subnet]
    App -->|NACL: allow 3306 from App CIDR only| PHI[Isolated PHI Subnet]
    PHI -->|NACL: allow ephemeral 1024-65535 back to App CIDR only| App
    PHI -.->|No route| Internet

    style PHI fill:#fee,stroke:#900,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    style App fill:#eef,stroke:#339,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
